        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a cold sweat... What was that noise from the closet? I don't remember this tunnel being here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONSTERS IN MY CLOSET</strong> is a spooky, nostalgic Virtual Reality experience full of scares, monsters, and an unreliable rechargeable flashlight! Can you make it all the way to the 100th floor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/c8e0efeea65c0a7e8a860df70109cc9e.poster.avif?t=1765549908\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/c8e0efeea65c0a7e8a860df70109cc9e.webm?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/c8e0efeea65c0a7e8a860df70109cc9e.mp4?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ENDLESS NIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon your bravery to descend to the 100th Floor. Only then will the nightmare end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/c1caf819166b99b7467ffc562515324f.poster.avif?t=1765549908\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/c1caf819166b99b7467ffc562515324f.webm?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/c1caf819166b99b7467ffc562515324f.mp4?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a complex, randomized system of scares thoughtfully scattered throughout a seemingly endless path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/1ab4b645aec6355936a2cc9d5b69f62b.poster.avif?t=1765549908\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/1ab4b645aec6355936a2cc9d5b69f62b.webm?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/1ab4b645aec6355936a2cc9d5b69f62b.mp4?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different monsters with unique behaviors...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Creeper: All he wants is love!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wanderer: Stay out of his way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chaser: Hope you can run fast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jumper: Don't freak out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Watcher: Keep your distance!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/79068621fcbefddaf744f7316720ea31.poster.avif?t=1765549908\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/79068621fcbefddaf744f7316720ea31.webm?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/79068621fcbefddaf744f7316720ea31.mp4?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TOOLS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unreliable shake-to-charge flashlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pair of legs ready to sprint. But don't run out of breath!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wit to know when to run and when to hide...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/dd07ff91464f9646bbde2d97ed58e9d8.poster.avif?t=1765549908\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/dd07ff91464f9646bbde2d97ed58e9d8.webm?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141570/extras/dd07ff91464f9646bbde2d97ed58e9d8.mp4?t=1765549908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMFORT AND VR GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roomscale or Seated experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple stealth mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive, addictive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect run with no mistakes could take 20-30 minutes (extremely unlikely)</p></li></ul>",
